{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 57,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.79139709472656,
        27.289522171020508,
        328.7294006347656,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "6. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS FOR TREATMENT OF PNEUMONIA",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        286.4375,
        59.52207946777344,
        399.0473327636719,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE tables A7.10 &",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        286.88287353515625,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "alternative to parenteral antibiotics in low HIV settings (",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.52207946777344,
        79.44290161132812,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "A7.11",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.77369689941406,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.1335754394531,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "). Oral amoxicillin is an effective and safe alternative to parenteral antibiotics",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.0729064941406,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "in low HIV settings in children with severe pneumonia (chest indrawing) who do not",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        227.31289672851562,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "have any other serious signs or symptoms.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.0516662597656,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Campbell et al (1988) compared oral co-trimoxazole versus IM procaine penicillin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.0229187011719,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "followed by oral ampicillin in 134 children with non-severe or severe pneumonia. At",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.1127014160156,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "day 7 of follow up, treatment failure occurred in 6 out of 66 patients (9.1%) in the oral",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.10296630859375,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "co-trimoxazole group and 7 out of 68 patients (10.2%) in the combined-treatment",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.00262451171875,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "group. The risk difference was not significant: -0.01% (95% CI -0.11 to 0.09). The study",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        379.3828125,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "reported one death during the follow-up period in the injectable therapy group.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        189.7421112060547,
        399.1015319824219,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Straus et al (1998) included 302 children with severe pneumonia and compared",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.0927429199219,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "oral cotrimoxazole (n=203) with oral amoxicillin (n=99). Treatment failure rates were",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        399.0828857421875,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "higher in the cotrimoxazole group (33%) compared to oral amoxicillin (18%) (RR",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        228.7421112060547,
        399.0728454589844,
        242.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "1.79; 95% CI 1.13 to 2.84). There was no significant association between antimicrobial",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        241.7421112060547,
        399.0828857421875,
        255.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "minimum inhibitory concentration and outcome among bacteraemic children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        254.7421112060547,
        238.62295532226562,
        268.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "treated with co-trimoxazole and amoxicillin.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        267.7420959472656,
        399.11151123046875,
        281.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Addo-yobo et al (2004) evaluated 1702 children with severe pneumonia, comparing",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        280.7420959472656,
        399.102783203125,
        294.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "oral amoxicillin (n = 857) versus IV penicillin (n = 845) for two days followed by oral",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        293.7420959472656,
        399.14276123046875,
        307.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "amoxicillin. After 48 hours, treatment failure occurred in 161 out of 845 patients",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        306.7420959472656,
        399.0726318359375,
        320.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "(19%) in the amoxicillin group and 167 out of 857 patients (19%) in the parenteral",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        319.7420959472656,
        399.042724609375,
        333.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "penicillin group. The risk difference was not significant: -0.4% (95% CI -4.2 to 3.3).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        332.7420959472656,
        399.082763671875,
        346.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "At the end of follow up (14 days), the cumulative proportion of deaths in each group",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        345.7420959472656,
        399.04296875,
        359.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "was 0.2% in oral versus 1% in parenteral, but this did not reach statistical significance",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        358.7420959472656,
        399.0528564453125,
        372.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "(RD -0.6%, 95% CI -0.1 to 1.3). The authors reported similar recovery in both groups",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        371.7420959472656,
        125.10289764404297,
        385.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "at 5 and 14 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        384.7420959472656,
        399.11138916015625,
        398.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Atkinson et al (2007) conducted a study in eight paediatric centres in England",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        397.7420959472656,
        399.1129150390625,
        411.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "(general district and tertiary hospitals) and enrolled all but the most severe cases",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        410.7420959472656,
        399.0928039550781,
        424.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "of pneumonia. Children were randomly assigned to a 7-day treatment of either",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        423.7420654296875,
        399.03271484375,
        437.2320861816406
      ],
      "text": "oral amoxicillin (n = 100) or IV benzyl penicillin (n = 103). The primary outcome",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        436.7420654296875,
        399.1028747558594,
        450.2320861816406
      ],
      "text": "examined was time for temperature to be < 38 °C for 24 continuous hours. The study",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        449.7420654296875,
        399.1127624511719,
        463.2320861816406
      ],
      "text": "found equivalence between the two treatments, with a median time of 1.3 days for the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        462.7420654296875,
        253.73297119140625,
        476.2320861816406
      ],
      "text": "primary outcome to be achieved in both groups.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        475.7420654296875,
        399.11138916015625,
        489.2320861816406
      ],
      "text": "Hazir et al 2008 compared hospitalization and parenteral ampicillin four times a",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        488.7420654296875,
        399.1228942871094,
        502.2320861816406
      ],
      "text": "day for 2 days followed by 3 days oral amoxicillin with ambulatory home-treatment",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        501.7420654296875,
        399.1627502441406,
        515.2320556640625
      ],
      "text": "(n = 1025) versus oral amoxicillin twice daily for 5 days (n = 1012). The primary",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        514.7420654296875,
        399.0528259277344,
        528.2320556640625
      ],
      "text": "outcome was treatment failure measured by clinical deterioration. There were 87",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        527.7420654296875,
        399.07275390625,
        541.2320556640625
      ],
      "text": "(8.6%) treatment failures in the hospitalization group and 77 (7.5%) treatment failures",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        540.7420654296875,
        399.06304931640625,
        554.2320556640625
      ],
      "text": "in the ambulatory group by day 6: a non-statistically significant risk difference of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        553.7420654296875,
        399.0628662109375,
        567.2320556640625
      ],
      "text": "1.1%, 95% CI - 1.3 to 3.5. Five (0.2%) children died within 14 days of enrolment, one",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        566.7420654296875,
        399.0329284667969,
        580.2320556640625
      ],
      "text": "in the ambulatory group and four in the hospitalized group. In each case, treatment",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        579.7420654296875,
        399.0328674316406,
        593.2320556640625
      ],
      "text": "failure was declared before death and the antibiotic had been changed. None of the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        592.7420654296875,
        323.7529602050781,
        606.2320556640625
      ],
      "text": "deaths were considered to be associated with treatment allocation.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        605.7420654296875,
        399.0516357421875,
        619.2320556640625
      ],
      "text": "Another RCT that compared day care versus hospital care management of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        618.7420654296875,
        399.052734375,
        632.2320556640625
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia [Ashraf, 2010], but did not compare an oral antibiotic arm with injectable",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.34979248046875,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.6927947998047,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "43",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}